{%- set lights = variants | filter(attribute="variant.appearance", value="light") -%}
# {{ theme.name }} for Zed

A {% for v in variants %}{{ v.variant.appearance }} ({{ v.variant.name }}){% if not loop.last %} and {% endif %}{% endfor %} theme family for the [Zed](https://zed.dev)
editor. {{ theme.description }}

{% if variants | length == 1 -%}
The variant ships in a single theme file
{%- elif variants | length == 2 -%}
Both variants ship in a single theme file
{%- else -%}
All {{ variants | length }} variants ship in a single theme file
{%- endif %} (`{{ theme.id }}.json`) exposing:

